              "attribution": "Content from Wikivoyage is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.",
              "excerpt": "Lisbon's western district is packed with famous monuments, especially along the riverbank. These include the Torre de Bel\u00e9m, the Monument to the Discoveries, and Jer\u00f3nimos Monastery. Museums include the Navy Museum, the Museu Colec\u00e7\u00e3o Berardo, and the National Coach Museum."
