              "attribution": "Content from Wikivoyage is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.",
              "excerpt": "The Bairro Alto, or \"Upper District\" (dare we say \"High Neighbourhood\"), has become Lisbon's youthful, trendy quarter. The district includes the Chiado neighbourhood, known for its numerous historic landmarks and theatres. Among the district's many sights are the S\u00e3o Bento Palace (where the Portuguese parliament meets), the Museu Nacional de Arte Antiga (a museum of antique art), and the Lisbon Botanical Gardens."
            },
            {
              "chunk_id": "c00f1210e5481690",
              "title": "Lisbon",
